2) Is it correct that the Shafi’is do not permit the transfer of zakat from one town to another? And if this is the case then would that mean one would have to distribute to the people of the city they currently reside in (European country where there is not as much need for the zakat)? Would it invalidate the Zakat by sending it overseas (e.g India, Pakistan, Bangladesh, Gaza etc)? 
